  "interpretation_and_limits": [
    "This is cross-sectional within-METABRIC 5-fold cross-validation, not an external-cohort validation.",
    "The fixed molecular modules overlap genes used to describe the targets: ESR1/PGR are in the luminal module and ERBB2/GRB7 are in the HER2 module. High ER/HER2 classification therefore measures expected marker-label concordance, not independent biological validation.",
    "PR_STATUS also overlaps PGR in the luminal module.",
    "GRADE association is modest; CELLULARITY prediction is below the majority-class accuracy and does not support using the current modules as a cellularity surrogate.",
    "No Ki-67/proliferation-index annotation was identified in the current cBioPortal attribute audit.",
    "The labels are study-provided clinical annotations; assay definitions and provenance must be verified before biological interpretation.",
